  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u1-v1",
      "text": "夏五月壬子初一，皇帝在崇元殿受朝贺，仪仗如制。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "e1d602fe4b6ba84abe300c31dfc96928fa295e57d49112ed85baad48fb9b4695",
      "originalEnd": 21,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 0,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u2-v1",
      "text": "因轻旱，诏洛京、魏府辖区今年夏苗税麦等减五分之一。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "8783d7e1fa36dd3fcd47b8852d6afb7c79089f9123bba4365cb3fd250dcc2c9e",
      "originalEnd": 52,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 21,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u3-v1",
      "text": "丙辰，御史中丞张昭远奏称：“汴州在梁朱氏称帝时号京都，唐庄宗平河南后改回宣武军。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2c906fcd119357e28efd549fb66f85e4bd36e71c25e6a4cb2491b7de2ab224b2",
      "originalEnd": 99,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 52,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u4-v1",
      "text": "明宗巡幸时，主管者趁修牙城挂梁时宫殿门匾，有识者私非议。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "9a4e5be07d9f520fa82aee5371a42e074834755eb8420df4fcbbde9b15ea7341",
      "originalEnd": 137,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 99,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u5-v1",
      "text": "日前皇帝巡视暂居梁苑，臣见牙城匾额一如明宗时，无都号有殿名，恐无典据。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "6c26ea1e96344cc8ed3ea763121889102a91d4cf89599a7b13bf5b790ef69dcc",
      "originalEnd": 181,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 137,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u6-v1",
      "text": "秦汉以来，皇帝所到多立宫名，",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "d7c2f5fa9d28e4dd1aaae33ed210e69f0031e9b0c23308ce243157afb7d54113",
      "originalEnd": 205,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 181,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u7-v1",
      "text": "近代隋在扬州立江都宫、太原汾阳宫、岐州仁寿宫；",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "fa9c62274c476e6b7c48aac5520091559f66c3ec40f9b52159f2052f88445c95",
      "originalEnd": 231,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 205,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u8-v1",
      "text": "唐在太原晋阳宫、同州长春宫、岐州九成宫。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "7334f045fbffc19d312eb4a6021085d347decf33cd7707a6763c00c67966b268",
      "originalEnd": 255,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 231,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u9-v1",
      "text": "宫中殿阁题匾，以似皇居。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "596e02711a2d5857e4c22949063ffa15a8919529a8dc068e36f3dbf1ee8877ef",
      "originalEnd": 271,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 255,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u10-v1",
      "text": "请依旧例，在汴州牙城门暂挂宫门匾，其余殿阁可方便命名。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "9d1143e38e254b556300c5192dbb1c42c18866e20d4b18e39013d9daeabf760c",
      "originalEnd": 303,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 271,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u11-v1",
      "text": "敕名行宫大宁宫。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "720fe88a5532be3f4087e5c66cef969ee54d89827177d34419d1541a9dba70fc",
      "originalEnd": 315,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 303,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u12-v1",
      "text": "湖南青草庙原封安流侯，进广利公；洞庭庙进灵济公；磊石庙原昭灵侯，进威显公；黄陵二妃庙原懿节庙，改昭烈庙，依马希范请求。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f4e52f9b3be56741b027185c882e8f141f9a2b188fe01ac3af86a4a954e9a4ca",
      "originalEnd": 381,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 315,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u13-v1",
      "text": "戊午，以前成德军节度判官张彭为太府卿。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "eae051e2e610156e61c3235a78a74fd6dd2acb1ae60b398a86c94dc92d874f4d",
      "originalEnd": 400,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 381,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u14-v1",
      "text": "壬戌，诏令在朝文武官员每人各呈上一份密封奏章。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f329fd9ed44bf516d9f2e2c8304b43abf85e3c5aef0b0cce3d57e2c774ca25a0",
      "originalEnd": 420,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 400,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u15-v1",
      "text": "奏事仍须严密封好后递进，务求补救政治上的缺失，以符合虚心听取意见的心意。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f9ca674f61daf2b623175e6031aa4f076a883babac808b69417df4d652044bd2",
      "originalEnd": 437,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 420,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u16-v1",
      "text": "甲子，以虞部郎中、知制诰于峤为中书舍人，户部郎中于遘为虞部郎中、知制诰，赠故太子少保退休官朱汉宾为司空。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "e7c12d30752439873e28357a9668001436f3488acd1166914ae41536a5f482dc",
      "originalEnd": 488,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 437,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u17-v1",
      "text": "乙丑，六宅使王继宏送义州衙前拘管，前洺州团练使高信送复州拘管，",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "0c77050b85eb3c567b7a3728bf4ce39adde41d25d49ce8eabc7f4e0cc2d61249",
      "originalEnd": 519,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 488,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u18-v1",
      "text": "因二人在崇礼门内喧争，被御史台弹劾。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "0262e0c4c5326b58e518ec83b7fcd74a643f5ff04c48b2a83e9d6da3d56454d2",
      "originalEnd": 537,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 519,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u19-v1",
      "text": "戊辰，翰林学士、户部员外郎、知制诰窦贞固改工部郎中、知制诰；翰林学士、都官郎中、知制诰李慎仪改中书舍人，赐金紫，都仍任学士。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "61fb3cb9a50e7343498c3c3db33c570b5236b663875054ac6056133dc177bcce",
      "originalEnd": 600,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 537,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u20-v1",
      "text": "庚午，封第二十一女长安公主，第十一妹乌氏寿安长公主，第十二妹史氏永寿长公主，第十三妹杜氏乐平长公主。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "01c6b819df1b04582ce2c37e0ae20c8f582d42aed13b052ce9c1a7cecff08b77",
      "originalEnd": 660,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 600,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u21-v1",
      "text": "壬申，天雄军节度使、守太傅、兼中书令、兴唐尹范延光进临清王，增食邑三千户；凤翔节度使、检校太师、兼中书令、西平王李从严进岐王。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "916a31e041f6c05fd24cf390d93a25dc61711006bac769ecc826a2d1e9ef82e6",
      "originalEnd": 725,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 660,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u22-v1",
      "text": "丙子，平卢军节度使、兼中书令王建立进临淄王；昭信军节度使、侍卫马军都指挥使景延广改宁江军节度使，仍掌军。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "54d5de6c5faed43a0f1d9eff672fe4d415b83c2e19afaf01cce3d66bb282e694",
      "originalEnd": 779,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 725,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u23-v1",
      "text": "太常卿梁文矩奏定四庙谥号、庙号、陵号，太常少卿裴垣奏定四庙皇后追尊谥号，获准。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "909f30b015c9599655391bad71db1da3817570c6a76a5569444c25d7bc030ced",
      "originalEnd": 818,
      "paragraphId": "old-v076-p9",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 779,
      "originalSha256": "7340b8aed8d8f39c1b76d2e8ad76e7136c749006c0ed8843c5dbf824e10c553a",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1196",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "66514a0abc69e0ae30eecb5240f89ea330da026aeb57174486fa5a51c9ee96a2",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v076-p9-u24-v1",
      "text": "戊寅，以中书舍人、暂管贡举的王延为御史中丞，翰林学士、户部侍郎、知制诰崔棁为兵部侍郎、承旨，翰林学士承旨、兵部侍郎程逊为检校礼部尚书、太常卿，检校吏部尚书、太常卿梁文矩为吏部尚书，御史中丞张昭远为户部侍郎，吏部尚书卢文纪为太子少傅。",
      "origin": "ai",
